# PC card team-farm (BENCH-204, TMODE-41..44): one screen arm @A@ (the tmtab build of work/team-farm-@A@.java, every team's entry changed one way), on the teams the arm changes (work/team-farm-@A@.txt), the same 6 seeds from 9400 as bb, against master (the aa build). Template: tfprep writes work/team-farm-@A@.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm.
--team
true
--seeds
6
--seed-base
9400
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-farm-@A@.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@@A@.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@@A@
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-farm-@V@-@A@
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-farm-@A@.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
